### Example requests. Open in VS Code with the "REST Client" extension and click "Send Request".
@base = http://localhost:8080

### Register a user
POST {{base}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "alice", "password": "secret123", "email": "alice@example.com" }

### Log in and keep the token
# @name login
POST {{base}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "alice", "password": "secret123" }

### Calendar feed (public)
GET {{base}}/api/events

### Events in October 2026
GET {{base}}/api/events?from=2026-10-01T00:00:00Z&to=2026-11-01T00:00:00Z

### Event and seat map (public)
GET {{base}}/api/events/1

###
GET {{base}}/api/events/1/seats

### Hold a seat. Send it twice with the same Idempotency-Key: the second returns DUPLICATE.
# @name hold
POST {{base}}/api/bookings
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}
Idempotency-Key: demo-key-1
Content-Type: application/json

{ "eventId": 1, "seatNo": "A01" }

### Pay (outcome: SUCCESS | DECLINE | SLOW | RANDOM). Returns 202; the result arrives through Kafka.
POST {{base}}/api/bookings/{{hold.response.body.booking.id}}/pay
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "outcome": "SUCCESS" }

### Booking status (poll until CONFIRMED / FAILED)
GET {{base}}/api/bookings/{{hold.response.body.booking.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}

### My bookings for the event
GET {{base}}/api/bookings?eventId=1
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}

### Release a held seat
POST {{base}}/api/bookings/{{hold.response.body.booking.id}}/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}

### DB-only baselines (for benchmarks)
POST {{base}}/api/baseline/bookings/atomic
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "eventId": 1, "seatNo": "J10" }

### Admin: log in (password is ADMIN_PASSWORD in .env)
# @name admin
POST {{base}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "admin", "password": "PASTE_FROM_.env" }

### Admin: create an event
POST {{base}}/api/admin/events
Authorization: Bearer {{admin.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Rock Night", "venue": "Open Air Arena", "startTime": "2026-11-20T14:30:00Z", "rows": 8, "seatsPerRow": 12, "price": 1199 }

### Admin: send reminder emails now (see http://localhost:8025)
POST {{base}}/api/admin/events/1/remind
Authorization: Bearer {{admin.response.body.token}}

### Admin: reset the event
POST {{base}}/api/admin/events/1/reset
Authorization: Bearer {{admin.response.body.token}}

### Admin: run reconciliation now
POST {{base}}/api/admin/events/1/reconcile
Authorization: Bearer {{admin.response.body.token}}

### Health and metrics
GET {{base}}/actuator/health

###
GET {{base}}/actuator/prometheus
